 "description": "$0.01 per call (x402, USDC on Base, no account). Use when you need revenue, profit, debt or headcount trends or a solvency view over several years. Romanian company financial statements (bilan\u021b ANAF) by CUI, per year, newest first, in RON: turnover (cifra de afaceri), revenue, expenses, gross/net profit, loss, employees, assets, stocks, receivables, cash, debts, equity, plus Altman Z' and ratios (liquidity, debt/equity, net margin, ROA, turnover per employee). Empty list if no filings.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "cui": {
    "description": "CUI / CIF (Romanian company tax ID, cod fiscal): digits with optional RO prefix, e.g. 2816464 or RO2816464. Get it with romania_company_search.",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "cui"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "romania_company_financials",
 "outputSchema": {
  "description": "structuredContent wraps the HTTP JSON array under \"years\"; the text content is the raw HTTP body.",
